\subsection{Gradient-Flow Control}
When $f(p) > 0$, the controller applies:
\begin{equation}
\frac{dp^i}{dt} = -\lambda\, g^{ij}\, \frac{\partial f}{\partial x^j},
\end{equation}
ensuring real-time stabilization.

